Terminal components from Termux (https://github.com/termux/termux-app), based on Terminal Emulator for Android (https://github.com/jackpal/Android-Terminal-Emulator).

Only terminal-emulator and terminal-view are included. Upstream LICENSE.md expressly lists these two libraries as Apache License 2.0 exceptions. The Termux application and termux-shared are excluded.

